===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|euphemistic}} Used to replace a word that might be considered [[unacceptable]] in a particular situation, when using a well-known phrase.
#: ''I think we should be prepared in case the '''[[shit|proverbial]]''' hits the fan.''
#: ''Are you [[take the piss|taking the '''proverbial''']]?''
# {{lb|en|euphemistic|in the plural}} The [[groin]] or the [[testicle]]s.
#: ''You'll find they've got you by the '''proverbials'''.''

